{"kind":"article","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/DisablingEntitiesAndUsingPrefabs","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"WorldModule"}],"title":"Disabling Entities and Using Prefabs","role":"article","roleHeading":"Article"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Disabled","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Prefab"],"title":"Disabling Entities and Using Prefabs","anchor":"Disabling-Entities-and-Using-Prefabs"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A game often keeps entities that shouldn’t take part in a step: an enemy waiting off screen, or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the template every goblin is copied from. A world hides those entities from queries and updates","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"while keeping their components, and it can copy any entity into a new one."}]},{"anchor":"Disable-an-Entity","level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Disable an Entity"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Insert "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Disabled"},{"type":"text","text":" into an entity to hide it from queries and updates. The entity stays live and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keeps its components, and reading it through its handle still works. A query or update reaches it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"only when it reads or writes "},{"code":"Disabled","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", names it in a filter, or allows it with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":".allowing(Disabled.self)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Remove the mark to bring the entity back.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"To make your own component types hide entities the same way, register them with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/registerDisablingComponent(_:)"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Disabling hides an entity from queries and updates only. The world’s "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/count"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/entities"},{"type":"text","text":" and the spans of "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/withSpan(of:_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" still include it."}]},{"anchor":"Clone-an-Entity","level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Clone an Entity"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/clone(_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" spawns a new entity holding a copy of every component of another. The copies"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are new components, so they count as added and fire add and insert hooks. A clone keeps the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"original’s relations, so a clone of a child is its sibling, but the original’s children aren’t"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cloned."}]},{"anchor":"Spawn-from-a-Prefab","level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Spawn from a Prefab"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"prefab","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" is an entity marked with ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Prefab","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" that holds a ready-made set of components. Queries","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and updates skip it, as they skip disabled entities, so the template never moves or takes damage","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"along with its copies. ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/spawn(from:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" copies a prefab without its mark, so the new entity","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"takes part like any other.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Commands","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" record clones and spawns from prefabs too, so a system can spawn copies during a","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"step. The following example spawns two goblins from a prefab through commands:"}]},{"code":["var world = World()","let goblin = world.spawn(Prefab(), Name(value: \"goblin\"), Health(current: 10))","","var commands = Commands()","commands.spawn(from: goblin)","commands.spawn(from: goblin)","world.apply(commands)","","print(world.query(Name.self).count)","\/\/ Prints \"2\"","print(world.count)","\/\/ Prints \"3\""],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To keep a prefab outside any world, such as in a file, save it as a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Scene","isActive":true},{"text":" and spawn its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"entities into a world with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"spawn(contentsOf:)"},{"type":"text","text":"; see "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/SavingAndLoadingWorlds","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}]